From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ivan Belokobylskiy <belokobylskij@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] rtk_hciattach: fix redirect warning

Include <poll.h> instead of <sys/poll.h> to avoid the
redirect warning with musl.

Signed-off-by: Ivan Belokobylskiy <belokobylskij@gmail.com>
---
--- a/hciattach.c
+++ b/hciattach.c
@@ -39,7 +39,7 @@
 #include <termios.h>
 #include <time.h>
 #include <sys/time.h>
-#include <sys/poll.h>
+#include <poll.h>
 #include <sys/param.h>
 #include <sys/ioctl.h>
 #include <sys/socket.h>
